{"id": "future-postcards", "title": "FUTURE POSTCARDS", "forSale": false, "productDescription": {"text": "Limited Edition of 100 Units Till the End of Time\n9 Digital printed postcards, hand-numbered and signed by the artist (Neil Cohen)\n\n8x 15x10.5cm Postcards\n\n1x Foldable 10.5x9 Postcard\n\n1x Craft envelope Hand stamped, hand numbered and signed by the artist", "blocks": [{"html": "<span><strong>Limited Edition of 100 Units Till the End of Time</strong></span><br>9 Digital printed postcards, hand-numbered and signed by the artist (Neil Cohen)", "text": "Limited Edition of 100 Units Till the End of Time\n9 Digital printed postcards, hand-numbered and signed by the artist (Neil Cohen)", "type": "p"}, {"html": "<li><p>8x 15x10.5cm Postcards</p></li><li><p>1x Foldable 10.5x9 Postcard</p></li><li><p>1x Craft envelope Hand stamped, hand numbered and signed by the artist</p></li>", "text": "8x 15x10.5cm Postcards\n\n1x Foldable 10.5x9 Postcard\n\n1x Craft envelope Hand stamped, hand numbered and signed by the artist", "type": "ul"}]}, "projectContent": [{"text": "Future Postcards visualize a fictional scenario of an Israeli-Palestinian peace agreement. First, the images were created using Ai grounded on reference images and digital compositing by artist Neil Cohen. Then the photos were incorporated into postcard layouts referencing Palphots postcards. Palphot, an Israeli monopoly in printed matter, especially postcards, from 1934 onward, still exists today.\n\nLayer breakdown of the compositing process", "blocks": [{"html": "Future Postcards visualize a fictional scenario of an Israeli-Palestinian peace agreement. First, the images were created using Ai grounded on reference images and digital compositing by artist Neil Cohen. Then the photos were incorporated into postcard layouts referencing <a href=\"https://www.palphot.com/palphot-at-a-glance/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Palphots</a> postcards. <a href=\"https://www.palphot.com/palphot-at-a-glance/\" rel=\"noo